        <mxCell id="wHbQeHQnOs_xXHUr79cz-42" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="1. A user should have a unique e-mail address&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. A user can list your establishments&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. A establishment should have a name, description and a user_id&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. A esblishment can list your queues&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;5. A queue should have a name and a establishemnt&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;6. A queue can list guests sorted FIFO&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;7. A Guest should have a name and optionally a phone number&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;8. A Guest shoud be inside a queue&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;9. A user can remove a guest from queue&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;10. A user can request the next guest from the queue&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;11. A user can add new guests into the queue&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
